      "title": "In the app",
      "items": [
        "Host shell and any container's shell, in the browser and the apps: xterm.js, vendored, loaded the first time a terminal opens",
        "Copy, paste, the wheel, resize: the terminal surface, feature for feature"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "On the agent",
      "items": [
        "ConPTY on Windows: the shell sees a real terminal (colours, vim, top); pipes and a client-side line editor elsewhere",
        "Terminal jobs: System → Compact VHDX types its script into the host shell"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Sessions",
      "items": [
        "A shell outlives the page: detached on leaving, taken over on return; ended by Close, Log out or the tab closing",
        "At the agent's own machine, Windows Terminal opens instead; never for a remote client"
